# ctrl-a-2 — шаги записи (что показывается — ctrl-a-2.md)
# Вторая часть Smart Ctrl+A: Custom (свои галочки шагов) и Last press clears highlighting.
# Этап 1 — умолчание, коротко; Smart Ctrl+A включается вместе с Custom во втором этапе.
title Smart Ctrl+A: your own steps | Choose where a press stops, and let the last press clear it
open Trip plan.md
caret - Day 1: train to the coast @ train
mark off
say Default: Ctrl+A selects the whole note
key Ctrl+A
expect ## Packing / - Clothes / ## Route

say Selection steps → Custom: tick where a press stops
settings Keyboard
set Smart Ctrl+A = on
set Selection steps = Custom
click word
click heading
pause 800
close
caret - Clothes @ Clothes
say Ctrl+A → word, line, section, note
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
expect ## Packing / - Clothes / ## Route

say Last press clears highlighting → on
settings Keyboard
set Last press clears highlighting = on
caret - Clothes @ Clothes
say After the note, one more press lets go
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
key Ctrl+A
expect ## Packing / - Clothes / ## Route
